# UTF-8 without BOM

When creating or rewriting text files in this repo, **omit the UTF-8 BOM**.

## Required

- Encoding: UTF-8 **without** BOM (`charset = utf-8` in [`.editorconfig`](.editorconfig))
- Line endings: LF (`end_of_line = lf`)
- Prefer editor/settings that save as `utf8` (not `utf8bom`) — matches [`.vscode/settings.json`](.vscode/settings.json)
- Applies to **all** text files, including `*.sln` (tabs only; no BOM)

## Do not

- Write a leading `EF BB BF` on any text file (`.cs`, `.csproj`, `.sln`, `.json`, `.md`, `.mdc`, manifests, etc.)
- Reintroduce CRLF when editing sources that were normalized to LF
